note EventMath v1.8 — Antoinette and Friends Sponsorship Analysis
note Show: intimate celebrity interview talk show hosted by Antoinette Peragine
note Guests: Jeff Bridges, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Emma Thompson, Danny DeVito,
note         George Lopez, Sharon Gless, Isabella Rossellini
note Platform: podcast (Apple/Spotify/Amazon), YouTube, tv.antoinetteandfriends.com
note Problem: cannot find consistent sponsorship

note ── The two fundamental states ──

event no sponsors
category state
matter
  description is pitching into silence
  energy is low
  direction is away
  visibility is low
  positioning is another podcast
  brand sees is unproven indie show
end
end

event sponsors committed
category state
matter
  description is recurring brand partnerships
  energy is high
  direction is toward
  visibility is high
  positioning is celebrity access vehicle
  brand sees is only channel to these guests
end
end

