zoom in on no sponsors and sponsors committed into pitch bridge
zoom opposite on pitch bridge into rejection bridge
zoom meta on no sponsors and sponsors committed and pitch bridge and rejection bridge into sponsorship field

note ── Weight the factors by observed importance ──

weight celebrity access at 5
weight audience proof at 3
weight niche clarity at 3
weight pitch positioning at 4
weight media kit at 2

note ── Candidate explanations for why sponsors aren't coming ──

event wrong pitch angle
category explanation
matter
  root cause is pitch positioning
  description is selling podcast downloads when selling celebrity adjacency
  blocking factor is very high
  fix is lead with the guest roster as the product
end
end

event no measurable proof
category explanation
matter
  root cause is audience proof
  description is sponsors cannot see download numbers or demographic data
  blocking factor is high
  fix is publish a media kit with listener demographics and episode reach
end
end

event wrong sponsor category
category explanation
matter
  root cause is niche clarity
  description is pitching general brands instead of prestige brands who want celebrity alignment
  blocking factor is high
  fix is target luxury automotive jewelry spirits and streaming services
end
end

event invisible positioning
category explanation
matter
  root cause is pitch positioning
  description is show looks like ten thousand other talk shows from the outside
  blocking factor is very high
  fix is lead with what makes it impossible to replicate
end
end

event no direct outreach
category explanation
matter
  root cause is audience proof
  description is waiting for inbound instead of warm introductions through guests
  blocking factor is medium
  fix is ask each guest to introduce one brand contact they trust
end
end

