note ── The dimensional model ──
note D-13: everything actively working AGAINST sponsorship
note       (crowded podcast market, generic talk show positioning,
note        brands defaulting to mega-reach platforms)
note D+13: the actual asset — intimate access to A-list talent
note       that brands cannot buy anywhere else at any price

event market noise
category state
matter
  description is thousands of celebrity interview podcasts competing for the same budgets
  signal is low
  differentiation is none
  energy is dispersed
  brands see is another show asking for money
end
end

event rare access
category state
matter
  description is Jeff Bridges chose this show George Lopez chose this show Arnold chose this show
  signal is maximum
  differentiation is unreplicable
  proof is IMDB credits and recorded episodes
  niche is luxury brand celebrity alignment through genuine relationship
  energy is concentrated
  brands cannot get this is anywhere else
end
end

