resonate pitch bridge and rejection bridge

note ── The answer ──
note The show does not need more downloads to get sponsors.
note It needs sponsors to understand what they are actually buying.
note
note WHAT THEY ARE BUYING:
note Brand X + [A-list guest who already said yes] = trust transfer
note That trust transfer is worth more than a CPM rate.
note No podcast network in the world can sell that because they don't have it.
note Antoinette does.
note
note THREE MOVES:
note 1. Rewrite the pitch deck: lead with the guest roster first, numbers second
note 2. Ask the next three guests for one warm intro to their brand manager
note 3. Target prestige categories: luxury auto, fine spirits, streaming services,
note    arts foundations, and wellness brands that want authentic celebrity voice
